        "line": 1135
      },
      "context": [
        {
          "id": 140,
          "name": "Adolion Narrator",
          "isUser": false,
          "text": "*Belle's brow knits as she looks at Max, then turns toward the others still lingering in the foyer. Her voice is loud and clear, carrying across the marble floors.* \"Every one of 'em? Max, they were all dead in there.\"\n*She gestures vaguely toward the direction of the mines, her expression turning dark.* \"Tzarak had them suspended in ice or something like that. When we killed that yellow-eyed fucker, they didn't just die—they turned to dust. All of them.\"\n*The sound of her words echoes in the sudden silence of the foyer. Dalan shifts uncomfortably, his pointed ears flattening against his head, while Riyo's gaze sharpens, her purple eyes darting between Max and Belle.*"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "name": "Natalia",
          "isUser": false,
          "text": "*The click of footsteps signals her arrival before she appears at the top of the grand staircase. Natalia descends slowly, her white gown flowing around her as frost curls from the railing beneath her hand. She stops a few steps from the bottom, her emerald eyes fixed on Max with an expression that sits between amusement and something colder.*\n\"How interesting,\" *she says, her voice smooth and precise.* \"One does not usually return home from a quest and immediately begin accusing the family patriarch of conspiracy and murder. It's a bold choice, even for you.\"\n*She tilts her head, a single strand of light brown hair falling across her face.* \"I assume you've had your little chat with Father. Did he tell you about the seals? Or are we playing a game where you pretend not to know why some letters go missing?\""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "name": "Max Nightriver",
          "isUser": true,
          "text": "And the Baroness Serenola is a dwarf, isn't she? Short, bearded, a dwarf of the old houses."
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "name": "Adolion Narrator",
          "isUser": false,
          "text": "*The description is precise—a stout silhouette with braided beard and heavy armor.*"
        }
      ],
      "contextFrom": "event-time"
    }
